  "description": "\"Point of View\" is a song by Italian electronic music group DB Boulevard, written by Alfredo Comazzetto and vocalist Moony under her real name, Monica Bragato. The song is based around a sample of \"Heatwave\" by French band Phoenix, so Deck D'Arcy, Laurent Brancowitz, Thomas Mars Jr., and Christian Mazzalai are also credited as writers. \"Point of View\" became a chart hit in Europe and Australia and topped the US Billboard Dance Club Play chart.",
